      <h2>Apple Photos &quot;No Location&quot; Feature vs Complete Metadata Stripping</h2>
      <p>
        In recent versions of iOS, Apple added a feature in the Photos app to adjust or remove location tags. While helpful, it leaves serious privacy vulnerabilities intact:
      </p>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
